{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e7c1a3d2-uam-auth-e2e-2026",
    "name": "UAM - Auth Service E2E",
    "description": "End-to-End test cho auth-service: register, login, role management.\n\n**Số test:** 8 requests\n\n**Cách chạy:**\n1. Import collection + environment `uam-e2e.postman_environment.json`\n2. Đảm bảo auth-service đang chạy ở localhost:8081\n3. Mở Postman Runner → chọn collection này → Run\n4. Tất cả test sẽ chạy tuần tự, kết quả PASS/FAIL hiển thị ngay\n\n**Trace flow:**\n- Tạo username random qua pre-request script (mỗi lần chạy là user mới)\n- Test 1 register → tự lưu token vào {{token}}\n- Test 4 login → cập nhật {{token}} mới\n- Test 7 dùng token user (không phải admin) → expect 403",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Register - Happy Path (201 Created)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Random username để mỗi lần chạy là user mới",
              "const randomSuffix = Math.floor(Math.random() * 1000000);",
              "const username = 'e2e_user_' + randomSuffix;",
              "pm.environment.set('username', username);",
              "console.log('Will register username:', username);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ApiResponse wrapper: success=true', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true);",
              "pm.test('ApiResponse contains token in data', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an('object');",
              "    pm.expect(json.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Has message + timestamp', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(json.message).to.equal('User registered successfully');",
              "    pm.expect(json.timestamp).to.be.a('string');",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Save token cho test sau",
              "pm.environment.set('token', json.data.token);",
              "console.log('Token saved:', json.data.token.substring(0, 30) + '...');"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/register",
          "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "register"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Register - Duplicate Username (409 Conflict)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 409 Conflict', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409));",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ApiResponse wrapper: success=false', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.false);",
              "pm.test('Message contains \"already exists\"', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.include('already exists');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/register",
          "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "register"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Register - Missing Password (400 Validation)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 400 Bad Request', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ApiResponse: success=false', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.false);",
              "pm.test('Message mentions password validation', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.include('password');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"missingpwd_{{$randomInt}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/register",
          "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "register"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Login - Happy Path (200 OK)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ApiResponse wrapper success=true', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true);",
              "pm.test('Returns new JWT token', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(json.data.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Message = Login successful', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(json.message).to.equal('Login successful');",
              "});",
              "",
              "// Update token (login token có thể khác register token về exp)",
              "pm.environment.set('token', json.data.token);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "login"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Login - Wrong Password (401 Unauthorized)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ApiResponse: success=false', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.false);",
              "pm.test('Message: Invalid username or password', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.include('invalid');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"wrongpassword999\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "login"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Login - Non-existent User (401 Unauthorized)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ApiResponse: success=false', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.false);",
              "pm.test('No information leak (generic message)', () => {",
              "    // Tránh leak \"user not found\" vs \"wrong password\" - đều trả message giống nhau",
              "    pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.include('invalid');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"definitely_does_not_exist_user_99999\",\n  \"password\": \"anypassword\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "login"]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Assign Role - Non-Admin Forbidden (403)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 403 Forbidden', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
              "",
              "const json = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ApiResponse: success=false', () => pm.expect(json.success).to.be.false);",
              "pm.test('Message: Access denied', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.include('access denied');",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{"key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}"}],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/admin/assign-role?username={{username}}&role=ROLE_ADMIN",
          "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "admin", "assign-role"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "username", "value": "{{username}}"},
            {"key": "role", "value": "ROLE_ADMIN"}
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Assign Role - No Token (401 Unauthorized)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Endpoint admin yêu cầu auth → không có token = 401 hoặc 403 (tùy security config)",
              "pm.test('Status code is 401 or 403', () => {",
              "    pm.expect([401, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{authBaseUrl}}/auth/admin/assign-role?username={{username}}&role=ROLE_ADMIN",
          "host": ["{{authBaseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "admin", "assign-role"],
          "query": [
            {"key": "username", "value": "{{username}}"},
            {"key": "role", "value": "ROLE_ADMIN"}
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}
